    "reason": "[ev-4b260bcbe57b] says the XRD `scope` field defaults to `Namespaced` in the new v2 XRD API. It also says v1 XRDs default to `LegacyCluster`, keep claims and don't use `spec.crossplane`. So only v2 XRDs that leave `spec.scope` unset get namespaced XRs by default. That is exactly the proposed exposure. v2 XRDs that set the scope explicitly (for example `Cluster`) choose their behaviour themselves, which fits the proposed overlap. The validator confirms that `spec.scope` exists in the v2.0.0 XRD schema and appears with the new v2 API version [ev-8b680076ce65].",
